    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seemu ya tsi yohewa atu a mbari ya Juda kulengana na miryango yao kpwa kupigirwa kura yaenea uphande wa mwakani kuphakana na tsi ya Edomu, hadi jangbwa ra Sini ririro mwakani zaidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mphaka wao kpwa uphande wa mwakani unaandzira mkpwono wa Bahari ya Munyu, ulolao mwakani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unaenderera mwakani hadi muunuko wa mwango Akirabimu, uchitsupira kanda ya jangbwa ra Sini na mwakani mwa mudzi wa Kadeshi-Barinea, uchitsupira mudzi wa Hezironi hadi mudzi wa Adari tsona uchigaluka kuelekeya mudzi wa Karika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula hipho mphaka watsupira mudzi wa Asimoni nao uchilunga chidzuho cha Misiri hadi kufikira baharini. Hinyu ndio mphaka wa uphande wa mwakani mwa Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mphaka wa uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa ni Bahari ya Munyu hadi phara muho Joridani unaphoinjirira baharini. Na mphaka wa vurini waandzira pho mkpwono wa Bahari ya Munyu ambapho muho Joridani unainjira baharini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mphaka uho uchitsupira Bethi-Hogila na uchienderera kuelekeya vurini mwa Bethi-Araba hadi kuriko na dziwe ra Bohani mwana wa Rubini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula hipho mphaka watsupira Dete ra Akori hadi Debiri, uchigaluka uphande wa vurini kuelekeya Giligali, mudzi urio ngʼambo ya Adumimu mwakani mwa ro dete. Kula hipho mphaka waenderera hadi visima vya Eni-Shemeshi na kpwenderera hadi Eni-Rogeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha mphaka uho watsupira phephi na Dete ra mwana wa Hinomu, kpwa uphande wa mwakani mwa mudzi wa Ajebusi — yani Jerusalemu kuelekeya chirere cha mwango urio mtswerero wa dzuwa wa Dete ra mwana wa Hinomu na kufikira mwisho wa Dete ra Arafa uphande wa vurini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula hipho chirere cha mwango mphaka waenderera hadi pula za madzi za Nefitoa, na kula phapho mphaka wafika midzi ya mwango Efuroni, chisha mphaka uchibeta kuelekeya Baala (Kiriathi-Jearimu). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao mphaka uchitsupa kula Baala, mudzi urio mtswerero wa dzuwa hadi mwango wa Seiri, na uchitsupa na uphande wa mwango Jearimu yani Kesaloni uphande wa vurini nao uchiphakpwa kuelekeya Kesaloni chisha uchitserera Bethi-Shemeshi na kuelekeya Timuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha uchielekeya uphande wa vurini mwa Ekironi uchizunguluka kuelekeya Shikeroni ambako watsupa phephi na mwango Baala hadi Jabineeli nao uchisirira Bahari Kulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mphaka wa uphande wa mtswerero wa dzuwa wakata Bahari Kulu. Hivi ndivyo vyokala miphaka ya seemu yohewa atu a mbari ya Juda kulengana na miryango yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
