                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela atu a Juda taayaweza kuazola Ajebusi, enyezi a Jerusalemu. Kpwa hivyo Ajebusi anaishi phamwenga na atu a Juda hiko Jerusalemu hadi rero.",
          "type": "text",
